# Memtrace background daemon state. It is rewritten while the daemon runs, so tracking
# it turns every branch switch into a conflict and risks committing a stale PID. Related:
# the evaluator already ignores .memdb/ so the daemon cannot be counted as an agent change.
.memdb/
